<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-05T11:16:51.491Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 11:16:51 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant attacks continue across Pakistan, with a blast killing three children in a gas cylinder explosion in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa and a shop roof collapse killing one and injuring six in Karachi. Baloch insurgent groups claim to have killed 40 Pakistani soldiers in 25 operations in Balochistan and to have killed seven soldiers in an attack involving women fighters, while security forces reported killing four terrorists in a Bajaur operation. Separate incidents include the killing of a Pakistani journalist in Karachi and the death of an Afghan woman among dozens deported, reflecting heightened security and humanitarian pressures. The conflict caused 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQLW1uV0ZWajNkdHBSbzEyY25GSm9jU0U3VE1mUUNnNnFfVGI3S0VZdXZoOUxYTWVuZVg3NmJYb21saXVVTWpiV2M4R3ZoekFmYW5CTWpVQ3ZjRS1oYkExc3JrWWRqcTlMUEJZV0lWWlFzN2JNNTdSRjRyUmszNFJkTmIyeWJ2dlV6X1hmX1JZRU5YWDc1Wnh4UGZDN2dGSWlGNHVuUWpSZ09pUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxOT1NwRnNjTzRXMFN3dndmcGdCMTdtSmttZERrUFVJMUR4QmFmVTFZM2RDOHZjbGs1ZUxqRW56ZWt4UjRKWXk1NENkNVdMTVVPVmdzNmxvRGh3OUVkMkNQdS01ektPR0N4RlNhbm9UWW00bVhOb2l4X29UcmRFd2ZNVlpNTE50Z1BpbmRnT0xPZHBual9feWp1dl8zaF9BRHN2d2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE9UU1RnRGMzYmJhbkxYZDM0SXpGNkVnQ0FxWnJHbGJTMEdqakdybGdOYmdwNGRiV1FqMy1uT2RvVlRJVGZuQWVnNw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxOc2lmMHh0ZVUzTVVFeFVzY0g3aDVjU1dwUll1OE5VX2NqSkUzem40SnYyU0xpTkdaWllBdE54Tk1KQXVyTUVJeFpDWTl3RTZQZG5GNk0wSzRXUUJadkR0UndFemF4eXpRaWxnMHM0ZXpSU2pDbG